"markdown": "### ControlCenter18\n\nThe full iOS 18 Control Center for iOS 16 and 17 (iPhone only).\n\nControlCenter18 brings the full iOS 18 Control Center to iOS 16 and 17. It's not a theme or a reskin: modules, pages and gestures work the same way they do on iOS 18.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
