{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Pages and Customizable Modules:** Add as many pages as you like and move between them with a swipe. Every module can be resized (1x1, 1x2, 2x2, or more flexible for the music player).\n- **Editing Right in Control Center:** Tap \"+\" in the top-left corner or long-press an empty spot to enter edit mode, then move or remove modules directly without opening Settings.\n- **Connectivity Module:** Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, AirDrop, Cellular Data, Personal Hotspot, VPN, and Airplane Mode combined into one module with full list views.\n- **Dynamic Music Player:** Shows album artwork with a soft glow matching the song's colors, just like iOS 18.\n- **Compatibility & Requirements:** Works on rootless and roothide jailbreaks for iOS 16 - 17 (iPhone only).",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
