"class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
"markdown": "### Version 3.0-beta\n- Fixed a SpringBoard crash with the Focus module on iOS 16.\n- Fixed the layout on Home button iPhones (iPhone 8, 8 Plus, SE) and with Gestures16: modules now keep the same proportions as on large iPhones.\n- Wi-Fi and Bluetooth lists now fit smaller screens.\n- Toggle icons, app shortcuts and modules from other tweaks are now visible on the Lock Screen; edit mode is unavailable while the iPhone is locked.\n- Fixed Timer and Flashlight icons disappearing and broken expand/collapse animations.\n- Hearing: the AirPods header and the headphone level are on separate platters, the icon no longer jumps and the corners are even.\n- Improved crash logs.",
